This assertion is based on the comment "@@@ If the return value is negative, new list doesnt contain x". The `PUT_IndexOfContract` method is assumed to return the index of the element if it is in the list. If the element does not exist in the list, it should return -1. Therefore, this assertion ensures that the element is indeed in the list, thus showing that the list contains the element.
